OL,3,ATwo Latvian men arrested on suspicion
OL,4,Aof trespass at RAF base
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Latvian men have been arrested
OL,7,Funder the National Security Act after a
OL,8,Ffence was breached at an RAF base in
OL,9,FCambridgeshire.
OL,11,FThe alert was raised when a Ministry of
OL,12,FDefence Police (MDP) security patrol at
OL,13,FRAF Molesworth identified an abandoned
OL,14,Fvehicle at about 22:00 BST on
OL,15,FWednesday.
OL,17,FAfter searches by the MDP and
OL,18,FCambridgeshire Constabulary, a small
OL,19,Fbreach of a perimeter fence was
OL,20,Fidentified a few hours later.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
