OL,3,AVenezuela's ex-leader Nicolas Maduro
OL,4,Acharged with conspiracy to commit
OL,5,Atorture
OL,6,
OL,7,FProsecutors in the United States have
OL,8,Faccused Venezuela's former leader
OL,9,FNicolas Maduro and his wife, Cilia
OL,10,FFlores, of conspiracy to commit
OL,11,Ftorture.
OL,13,FThe fresh charges against the couple
OL,14,Fwere made public on Thursday and are in
OL,15,Faddition to the drug-trafficking and
OL,16,Fweapons charges already brought against
OL,17,Fthem, which they have denied.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
