OL,3,AResidents airlifted to safety after
OL,4,Aflooding in central Chile
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey have warned that this year's
OL,7,Funusually strong El Nino climate
OL,8,Fphenomenon will likely continue to
OL,9,Fbring unusually wet weather, powerful
OL,10,Fwinds and storms to the region during
OL,11,Fthe southern hemisphere's spring.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
